ReplenishPlusPlus
Copyright (c) 2026 Mitra-88

The short version, for humans:

- Server owners: you may inspect, edit, and compile this plugin (or hire a
  developer to do it for you) and run it on your own Minecraft server
  network. That's completely fine.
- Developers: you may fork this, modify it, and distribute your own builds.
  Also fine, as long as it stays free and credits this project.
- Nobody may sell ReplenishPlusPlus, bundle it into paid commissions, or
  put builds behind a paywall on marketplaces like BuiltByBit, SpigotMC,
  Polymart, or Tebex.

The spirit of it: use it, learn from it, build on it. Just give back to the
maintainers instead of profiting off their work.

This file is the plain-language license for the project. It's written by a
solo developer, not a law firm, but the rules are simple and they're the
whole deal: be cool, don't paywall other people's work.
